{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Attic, where abandoned plush toys known as PlushKyn have transformed a dusty attic into a vibrant, competitive Playland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left behind by their owners, the PlushKyn have built a world of their own; full of mischief, charm, and surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a game that blends nostalgia, creativity, and fast-paced party game action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/4fd964e6afb5d9cc1154ac80b557dde0.poster.avif?t=1768307508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/4fd964e6afb5d9cc1154ac80b557dde0.webm?t=1768307508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/4fd964e6afb5d9cc1154ac80b557dde0.mp4?t=1768307508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a wide variety of imaginative party games, ranging from frantic races, to dance challenges and eliminations matches. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is designed for quick sessions and chaotic fun, keeping every playthrough fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/333d9372cf19dae4be8b22cf72985c0f.poster.avif?t=1768307508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/333d9372cf19dae4be8b22cf72985c0f.webm?t=1768307508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/333d9372cf19dae4be8b22cf72985c0f.mp4?t=1768307508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up with friends, form groups, and wander through themed hangouts like the Space Disco, Jungle Camp, Train Station, and Beach Bar. Every corner hides something new to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THE ATTIC:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\u00a020+ unique Party Games. 5+ attic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Unlock rewards as you level up, take on new challenges with our  battle pass, and dive into seasonal events. The attic is always changing, with new surprises waiting around every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Show off your style! Customize your PlushKyn with a huge variety of cosmetics; mix and match different skins, eyes, arms, and more. With up to 10 different traits to tweak, your PlushKyn will be as unique as you are. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc5\u00a0<strong>A Living World:</strong> The attic evolves with regular updates, new games, and fresh content shaped by the community.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore, compete, and create memories in a world built by forgotten toys?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840260?t=1768307508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840260?t=1768307508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/9307ef812401d5b96e4e58a0afac5459036d577e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768307508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/9307ef812401d5b96e4e58a0afac5459036d577e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768307508","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Scree